    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$farce_intro",
        "key": "$farce_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, so why did you charge this place with those Archosauria again?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_337_utage_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, I saw a village here, and I just thought it'd be fun to start a fight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_1",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...I guess that's our Utage. Yer like a whole 'nother gal in a fight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_1",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Aww, I'm sorry...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_337_utage_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But how did you even manage to round up these guys without speaking their language?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_337_utage_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Honestly, I don't really know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_jungleentrance",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Urgh, my nails are ruined. I'm so pissed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "text": "And just where the hell did my nail kit go? Now I'm twice as pissed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "text": "And I'm hella gross and sweaty after that fight. Plus, the air here is so humid, my clothes are totally soaked. Now I'm three times as pissed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "text": "And I'm, like, just walking around. Why do these Archosauria people keep coming up to me, picking fights? Now I'm four times as pissed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "And I only tagged along 'cause I heard this would be a nice place for a vacation. This is totally not a vacation spot!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm? Is someone sneaking up on me? Are those... Archosauria?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_jungle_1",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then I beat up all the sneaky dudes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "text": "And then some more of them came, so I beat all of them up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "text": "And somehow they all started to, like, worship me for some reason.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, I see. They probably thought you were some kind of exotic animal. After all, no one from around here looks like you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh?! Are you blind? How do you mistake a cutie like me for an animal?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Uh, well, to tell you the truth, you probably do look kinda like a freak to the Archosauria.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "text": "Also, I spotted the Great Wood Tribe's leader among your people, so I asked him. Apparently you're their leader now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm what?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Basically, you defeated the tribe's leader, and they're following you around because they look up to you as their leader now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? They don't even understand a word I'm saying! I thought they were just tagging along for fun!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's what happens when you're strong enough here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What should I do, Doctor...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "It's your mess. Figure it out yourself.;......;Might as well stick around and lead them.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nnng... so mean!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nng... Don't look at me like that, Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "text": "I didn't mean to...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Eh? I don't wanna! Life without TV and AC? You might as well just kill me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whatever, we found you and Croissant. Now we just need to look for Blaze.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_337_utage_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Blaze is probably fine. I can't imagine anything slowing her down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_201_moeshd"
    },
    {
        "text": "Me neither. Oh, yeah, Baws, what's the plan now? We goin' to the Temple fer that ceremony Gavial was talkin' about?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, right, you two haven't heard yet. Doctor, why don't you tell them?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_black",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "Explain the situation to Utage and Croissant."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_jungle_1",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_201_moeshd"
    },
    {
        "text": "Uh huh. Alrighty then, so we gon' be lookin' fer this Zumama to get yer engine back?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_337_utage_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Eh? You mean the ceremony's over already?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_337_utage_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yep.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_337_utage_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Then what did I even come here for?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whatever, it doesn't sound like something I'd care about anyway.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "text": "Also, Gavial, I thought you said this was a vacation spot!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_337_utage_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? You don't think this place is great?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_337_utage_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, actually, I guess, yeah, it's great!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, like, nothing here screams 'vacation!'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_337_utage_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What screams 'vacation' to you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_337_utage_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Like, beaches, oceans, parasols, and ice cream!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "text": "I even got myself a new swimsuit! I've been wearing it underneath my outfit since before we left!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_1",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Eh, and here I tagged along just 'cause I got nothin' else to do...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Uh, I never said there's anything like that around here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_337_utage_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Didn't you say we were gonna play in the water?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
        "name2": "char_337_utage_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Well yeah, that we can do. There's a huge waterfall deep in the rainforest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "And since we're heading to Zumama's tribe, we'll pass by the waterfall for sure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hell, I brought my swimsuit too. I just haven't taken it out yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
        "name2": "char_337_utage_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Really? Awesome!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_jungle_1",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_075"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, it looks like you found who you're looking for.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, Inam, thanks to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No problem.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh I just remembered, where's Tomimi? I thought she was supposed to be with you guys.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No idea. I think she had something else to take care of. We'll group up with her later.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, bring her these books, then, will you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What do we have here? 'City Beauty', 'Mastering Corporate Management in 100 Days', 'How to Become a Fashion Expert'...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "These are some weird titles!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "She's been learning Sargonian and what life in the outside world is like. After I taught her the basics, of course.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm, I can't imagine these books help much with her Sargonian.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're right. But that's really how she learned it. Letter by letter, word by word.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "text": "It may not be the best material to learn from, but it was more painful to see her not having a clue where to start.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's also why I decided to teach her Sargonian.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You know, Gavial, she's really working hard to get to where you are.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...You don't need to tell me. I know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But well, I don't know that much about what it's like outside either. Besides, I can only bring so many books with me, so I don't really know whether she's learning anything useful from them, haha.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...No wonder there's always something weird about her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hang on, don't tell me you're the one who taught Zumama Sargonian too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_075",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Nope. I'm pretty curious about that myself. She did have me find her books on machinery, but it was like she just picked up Sargonian out of nowhere.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "text": "And she's even teaching it to her tribe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Doctor, what do you think?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "She's quite ambitious.;......;How much for this rock?",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You think so too, huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You want me to think about it myself, huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm, alright. I'll settle this my way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_075"
    },
    {
        "text": "Since you're a new customer, I'll let you have it for 300 dinar.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's the look of a Doctor who just doesn't care.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_201_moeshd"
    },
    {
        "text": "Eh? T'ain't nothin' wrong with her teachin' Sargonian. If'n people here could talk with folks out there, they'd live a lot better.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_075",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe. The way I think about it, compared to your supposedly much better lives, I think our way of life out here is satisfying enough.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't think you city folks would understand, though.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_075",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That so...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_1",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, I think I get it! I mean, I lived in the countryside back in Higashi, too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_1",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Eh? I took you for a city girl, what with how trendy you are.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_1",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Nope, this is just the kinda stuff I like.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_075"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Yawn*... I'm tired... time for a nap.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_075"
    },
    {
        "text": "Here at our tribe, anything we leave out's for trade. If something catches your eye, have Gavial translate for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Wait.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_075"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "I've got a favor to ask you, too.",
        "values": 1
    },
